msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.4, you can check which renderer is currently used with the "
"built-in defines ``CURRENT_RENDERER``, ``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY``, "
"``RENDERER_MOBILE``, and ``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS``:"
msgstr ""
"Desde Godot 4.4, puedes comprobar qué renderizador se utiliza actualmente "
"con las definiciones integradas ``CURRENT_RENDERER``, "
"``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY``, ``RENDERER_MOBILE`` y ``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS``:"

msgid "``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY`` is always ``0``."
msgstr "``RENDERER_COMPATIBILITY`` siempre es ``0``."

msgid "``RENDERER_MOBILE`` is always ``1``."
msgstr "``RENDERER_MOBILE`` siempre es ``1``."

msgid "``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS`` is always ``2``."
msgstr "``RENDERER_FORWARD_PLUS`` siempre es ``2``."
